 pb-[100px] pt-10"><div><h1 class="mb-6 text-center text-3xl font-bold dark:text-zinc-100 md:text-5xl">What People Are Saying</h1></div><div class="mb-6 text-xl dark:text-zinc-100 md:text-xl">Don’t just take our word for it. Here’s what<!-- --> <span class="font-bold">real people</span> are saying about Critique.</div><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden"><div class="relative flex h-full w-full flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-background py-4 sm:py-20 md:py-20 xl:py-20"><div class="group flex overflow-hidden p-2 [--gap:1rem] [gap:var(--gap)] flex-row [--duration:20s]"><div class="flex shrink-0 justify-around [gap:var(--gap)] animate-marquee flex-row group-hover:[animation-play-state:paused]"><figure class="relative w-64 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-xl border p-4 border-gray-950/[.1] bg-gray-950/[.01] hover:bg-gray-950/[.05] dark:border-gray-50/[.1] dark:bg-gray-50/[.10] dark:hover:bg-gray-50/[.15]"><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-2"><img class="rounded-full" width="32" height="32" alt="" src="https://avatar.vercel.sh/jack"/><div class="flex flex-col"><figcaption class="text-sm font-medium dark:text-white"></figcaption><p class="text-xs font-medium dark:text-white/40">@pdb307</p></div></div><blockquote class="mt-2 text-sm">Real-time fact-checking is a game-changer.</blockquote></figure><figure class="relative w-64 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-xl border p-4 border-gray-950/[.1] bg-gray-950/[.01] hover:bg-gray-950/[.05] dark:border-gray-50/[.1] dark:bg-gray-50/[.10] dark:hover:bg-gray-50/[.15]"><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-2"><img class="rounded-full" width="32" height="32" alt="" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVQ1kqAdRsW2ItwxAUO4NgZJp_j_UyaIyYnauSZC3ZMGDPxSuc=s48-w48-h48"/><div class="flex flex-col"><figcaption class="text-sm font-medium dark:text-white"></figcaption><p class="text-xs font-medium dark:text-white/40">@judyjjo</p></div></div><blockquote class="mt-2 text-sm">It&#x27;s great how quickly I can tell how reliable a news source is.</blockquote></figure><figure class="relative w-64 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-xl border p-4 border-gray-950/[.1] bg-gray-950/[.01] hover:bg-gray-950/[.05] dark:border-gray-50/[.1] dark:bg-gray-50/[.10] dark:hover:bg-gray-50/[.15]"><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-2"><img class="rounded-full" width="32" height="32" alt="" src="https://avatar.vercel.sh/jill"/><div class="flex flex-col"><figcaption class="text-sm font-medium dark:text-white"></figcaption><p class="text-xs font-medium dark:text-white/40">@evosae</p></div></div><blockquote class="mt-2 text-sm">upped the quality of information I consume online.</blockquote></figure><figure class="relative w-64 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-xl border p-4 border-gray-950/[.1] bg-gray-950/[.01] hover:bg-gray-950/[.05] dark:border-gray-50/[.1] dark:bg-gray-50/[.10] dark:hover:bg-gray-50/[.15]"><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-2"><img class="rounded-full" width="32" height="32" alt="" src="https://avatar.vercel.sh/john"/><div class="flex flex-col"><figcaption class="text-sm font-medium dark:text-white"></figcaption><p class="text-xs font-medium dark:text-white/40">@shamoki</p></div></div><blockquote class="mt-2 text-sm">being able to fact check my friends on x is amazing</blockquote></figure><figure class="relative w-64 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-xl border p-4 border-gray-950/[.1] bg-gray-950/[.01] hover:bg-gray-950/[.05] dark:border-gray-50/[.1] dark:bg-gray-50/[.10] dark:hover:bg-gray-50/[.15]"><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-2"><img class="rounded-full" width="32" height="32" alt="" src="https://avatar.vercel.sh/jane"/><div class="flex flex-col"><figcaption class="text-sm font-medium dark:text-white"></figcaption><p class="text-xs font-medium dark:text-white/40">@jd</p></div></div><blockquote class="mt-2 text-sm">being able to confirm questionable things I read saves me so much time</blockquote></figure><figure class="relative w-64 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-xl border p-4 border-gray-950/[.1] bg-gray-950/[.01] hover:bg-gray-950/[.05] dark:border-gray-50/[.1] dark:bg-gray-50/[.10] dark:hover:bg-gray-50/[.15]"><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-2"><img class="rounded-full" width="32" height="32" alt="" src="https://freight.cargo.site/w/750/h/563/i/H1895326142106105842214117311220/image_2023-04-24_220431137-11.png"/><div class="flex flex-col"><figcaption class="text-sm font-medium dark:text-white"></figcaption><p class="text-xs font-medium dark:text-white/40">@daysofshiva</p></div></div><blockquote class="mt-2 text-sm">Critique is godlike sometimes. I&#x27;m looking at job postings and doing research about the company and it catches all the lies that show up in things like youtube comments or articles</blockquote></figure><figure class="relative w-64 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-xl border p-4 border-gray-950/[.1] bg-gray-950/[.01] hover:bg-gray-950/[.05] dark:border-gray-50/[.1] dark:bg-gray-50/[.10] dark:hover:bg-gray-50/[.15]"><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-2"><img class="rounded-full" width="32" height="32" alt="" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKTLXeD3GJyBU_7PsN7Jh_oFP1sfrPaUTnexvdMSVPfW6WeNQ=s48-w48-h48"/><div class="flex flex-col"><figcaption class="text-sm font-medium dark:text-white"></figcaption><p class="text-xs font-medium dark:text-white/40">@modragon</p></div></div><blockquote class="mt-2 text-sm">I cannot emphasize enough how much time this plugin saves me, as well as how much useful background I get on news and social media comments. I use Critique primarily for researching stock picks based on news and making better trades.</blockquote></figure></div><div class="flex shrink-0 justify-around [gap:var(--gap)] animate-marquee flex-row group-hover:[animation-play-state:paused]"><figure class="relative w-64 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-xl border p-4 border-gray-950/[.1] bg-gray-950