essments, and comprehensive insights directly as you browse your favorite sites like Reddit, YouTube, and more. It also enabled you to select any text on the internet, and converse about it. Stay tuned, as we incrementally bring you more AI-native features and eventually, the browser.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{\"value\":\"item-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"children\":\"How does Critique verify the information?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"children\":\"At the heart of Critique's algorithms are Large Language Models as agents,each generating scanning and cross-referencing information on the web in real-time. The information is then used as input to various heuristic based algorithms to verify credible sources in real-time. It assesses the reliability of content and provides users with an easy-to-understand credibility score.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{\"value\":\"item-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"children\":\"Can I use Critique on any website?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"children\":\"Currently, Critique supports autonomously vetting the content you see on major content platforms like Reddit, YouTube, Twitter, LinkedIn, BlueSky, and Threads. Critique also generates autonomously a summary of the articles you see on most online news platforms, as well as any website. We are actively working to expand our capabilities to include other social media platforms and content sites such as Facebook, Google Docs, and other news outlets. You can also manually select a text and ask Critique to vet the information on any site on the internet, aside from the coverage mentioned above.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{\"value\":\"item-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"children\":\"How does Critique handle user data? \"}],[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"children\":\"We are currently collecting data on the critiques that are generated, and when provided, user feedback on them. All data handling complies with the highest standards of privacy and data protection laws.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{\"value\":\"item-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"children\":\"How do I install Critique?  \"}],[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"children\":\"You can download and install Critique directly from our website or via the browser extension marketplaces. Just click on the download button atop the page!\"}]]}]]}]}]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full px-8 xl:hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L24\",null,{\"type\":\"single\",\"collapsible\":true,\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{\"value\":\"item-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"children\":\"About Critique\"}],[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"children\":\"Critique is building a redesigned browser, one with AI inbuilt at your fingertips. While we build this out, we are providing a small subset of the features as an early beta in the form of a browser extension. This intermediate extension provides real-time fact-checking,  content credibility assessments, and comprehensive insights directly as you browse your favorite sites like Reddit, YouTube, and more. It also enabled you to select any text on the internet, and converse about it. Stay tuned, as we incrementally bring you more AI-native features and eventually, the browser.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{\"value\":\"item-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"children\":\"How does Critique verify the information?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"children\":\"At the heart of Critique's algorithms are Large Language Models as agents,each generating scanning and cross-referencing information on the web in real-time. The information is then used as input to various heuristic based algorithms to verify credible sources in real-time. It assesses the reliability of content and provides users with an easy-to-understand credibility score.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{\"value\":\"item-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"children\":\"Can I use Critique on any website?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"children\":\"Currently, Critique supports autonomously vetting the content you see on major content platforms like Reddit, YouTube, Twitter, LinkedIn, BlueSky, and Threads. Critique also generates autonomously a summary of the articles you see on most online news platforms, as well as any website. We are actively working to expand our capabilities to include other social media platforms and content sites such as Facebook, Google Docs, and other news outlets. You can also manually select a text and ask Critique to vet the information on any site on the internet, aside from the coverage mentioned above.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{\"value\":\"item-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"children\":\"How does Critique handle user data? \"}],[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"children\":\"We are currently collecting data on the critiques that are generated, and when provided, user feedback on them. All data handling complies with the highest standards of privacy and data protection laws.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{\"value\":\"item-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"children\":\"How do I install Critique?  \"}],[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"children\":\"You can download and install Critique directly from our website or via the browser extension marketplaces. Just click on the download button atop the page!\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden xl:block w-full mt-5\",\"id\":\"blog-and-features\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex w-full justify-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"items-center flex flex-col gap-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{\"text\":\"Add To Your Browser\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-80\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L28\",null,{\"title\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center space-x-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1766283284370305025/QKXW5W3M_400x400.jpg\",\"height\":\"20\",\"width\":\"20\",\"alt\":\"thumbnail\",\"